    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classanonymous__namespace_02_a_r_m_unwind_op_asm_8cpp_03_1_1_unwind_opcode_streamer" kindref="compound">UnwindOpcodeStreamer</ref> - The simple wrapper over <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_small_vector" kindref="compound">SmallVector</ref> to emit bytes with MSB to LSB per <ref refid="classuint32__t" kindref="compound">uint32_t</ref> ordering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For example, the first byte will be placed in Vec[3], and the following bytes will be placed in 2, 1, 0, 7, 6, 5, 4, 11, 10, 9, 8, and so on. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
